  "notes": "{横|よこ} indicates the horizontal dimension or the area beside something.\n\nSENSE 1 - BESIDE/SIDE:\n- {横|よこ}に{座|すわ}る: to sit beside\n- {横|よこ}から{見|み}る: to look from the side\n- {横|よこ}に{並|なら}ぶ: to line up side by side\n- Xの{横|よこ}に: beside X\n\nSENSE 2 - HORIZONTAL/WIDTH:\n- {横|よこ}{書|が}き: horizontal writing\n- {横|よこ}の{線|せん}: horizontal line\n- {横|よこ}に{長|なが}い: wide (horizontally long)\n\nOPPOSITE:\n{縦|たて} (vertical, length) ↔ {横|よこ} (horizontal, width)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {横断|おうだん}: crossing (横断{歩道|ほどう} = crosswalk)\n- {横顔|よこがお}: profile (side view of face)",
